{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have secured a seat on the diligence for tomorrow, departing Kassel at six to Giessen, where the road splits for Koblenz. The heat here is oppressive; I paid three Kreuzers for a bottle of water at the post office, which felt like robbery, though the clerk was polite enough. I have been walking the streets to cool off. The town is neat but lacks the grandeur of Berlin. I saw a group of students playing whist in a tavern; their form was poor, but their enthusiasm was loud.\n\nRegarding your last letter: I am well, though my shoes are wearing thin. I think of Karl and Immanuel often. The journey is tiring, but the view from the window is pleasant. Do not worry about my health. I will write again when I reach Giessen.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795218844,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":1094,"total_tokens":1276,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-q3QOwUPt8FpmBt1kEjdmb08IDMjSf8n4","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1094,"prompt_ms":1093.808,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9998244972577697,"prompt_per_second":1000.1755335488496,"predicted_n":182,"predicted_ms":4347.957,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.02186187845304,"predicted_per_second":41.62874655844112}}